{"at":"2026-11-11T11:53:16.672Z","account":"music-tools-x","platform":"x","status":"published","source":"manual","slotId":"music-tools-x:workflow:43015607515","text":"メロディ作りに「コード進行」より偶然がほしい人へ。Wave Theoryはウェーブテーブルの形を、キーに沿ったMIDIメロディに変えるプラグイン。音源ではないのでシンセの前段に挿して使う。アルペジエーターで満足なら急がなくてよさそう。","mediaUrl":null,"mediaType":"image","mediaAltText":null,"mediaQa":null,"mediaResolution":null,"commercial":{"kind":"organic","paidPartnership":false},"providerPostId":"2120485004857758093","ai":null,"features":null,"rationale":null,"predictedScore":null,"selectionMode":null,"experiment":null,"sources":[],"textHash":"ccc7ce6d7ad5eb442825"}
{"at":"2026-11-12T07:40:07.491Z","account":"music-tools-x","platform":"x","status":"published","source":"manual","slotId":"music-tools-x:workflow:43176919746","text":"録音ボタンを押す前の「今の音」を拾いたい人へ。 Bird'sのRolling Samplerは、通った音を循環録音し、欲しい部分だけドラッグで取り出せる。 音作り中の偶然を残す道具。DAWの遡及録音で足りているなら追加不要。","mediaUrl":"https://static1.squarespace.com/static/631c5e1bbb48726432037171/t/6711a3373606f60c9026afec/1729209143874/rs-themes.png","mediaType":"image","mediaAltText":null,"mediaQa":null,"mediaResolution":null,"commercial":{"kind":"organic","paidPartnership":false},"providerPostId":"2120783684504567984","ai":null,"features":null,"rationale":null,"predictedScore":null,"selectionMode":null,"experiment":null,"sources":[],"textHash":"b73a94f8b69151d38341"}
{"at":"2026-11-13T00:13:35.032Z","account":"music-tools-x","platform":"x","status":"published","source":"manual","slotId":"music-tools-x:workflow:43335320079","text":"エフェクトをケーブルで自由につなぎたい人へ。TangleはDAW内で組むモジュラーFXラック。ラックと6モジュール、CV・クロック系は無料。残りは別料金なので、まず無料分でパッチングが自分に合うか試せます。 https://weaveraudio.com/","mediaUrl":null,"mediaType":"image","mediaAltText":null,"mediaQa":null,"mediaResolution":null,"commercial":{"kind":"organic","paidPartnership":false},"providerPostId":"2121033696811589894","ai":null,"features":null,"rationale":null,"predictedScore":null,"selectionMode":null,"experiment":null,"sources":[],"textHash":"4b481a68a0f16cd0e0af"}
{"at":"2026-11-13T11:18:52.544Z","account":"music-tools-x","platform":"x","status":"published","source":"manual","slotId":"music-tools-x:workflow:43416025364","text":"録ったボーカルや旋律を、音符単位で動かす無料ピッチエディタ「bubblegum」。音程だけでなく、音符の位置や長さも編集できます。手作業でフレーズを整えたい人向け。自動補正だけで足りるなら追加不要。","mediaUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Mre7T837yqE/maxresdefault.jpg","mediaType":"image","mediaAltText":null,"mediaQa":null,"mediaResolution":null,"commercial":{"kind":"organic","paidPartnership":false},"providerPostId":"2121201122769510777","ai":null,"features":null,"rationale":null,"predictedScore":null,"selectionMode":null,"experiment":null,"sources":[],"textHash":"3f2a6805984d0da7f8a9"}
{"at":"2026-11-14T00:34:36.081Z","account":"music-tools-x","platform":"x","status":"published","source":"manual","slotId":"music-tools-x:workflow:43535087499","text":"音を「音程のある響き」に変えたい人へ。Polarity-RESは最大32個の共鳴点をスペクトラム上に置ける無料エフェクト。音符や倍音に合わせて配置でき、ノイズから音階感のある質感も作れます。普通のEQで十分なら追加は不要。","mediaUrl":"https://polarity.productions/polarity-res/assets/images/polarity-res-cover.jpg","mediaType":"image","mediaAltText":null,"mediaQa":null,"mediaResolution":null,"commercial":{"kind":"organic","paidPartnership":false},"providerPostId":"2121401373564514444","ai":null,"features":null,"rationale":null,"predictedScore":null,"selectionMode":null,"experiment":null,"sources":[],"textHash":"773ffbe13219b4f62812"}
{"at":"2026-11-14T11:17:34.888Z","account":"music-tools-x","platform":"x","status":"published","source":"manual","slotId":"music-tools-x:workflow:43589294647","text":"口琴のような倍音をシンセで探したい人へ。SuperDuper DSPのKubyzは、倍音や母音の響きを調整できる無料のオープンソース音源。一般的なシンセの音色で足りているなら、追加は不要。","mediaUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fortunto2/superduper-dsp/main/docs/screenshots/kubyz.png","mediaType":"image","mediaAltText":null,"mediaQa":null,"mediaResolution":null,"commercial":{"kind":"organic","paidPartnership":false},"providerPostId":"2121563184771314046","ai":null,"features":null,"rationale":null,"predictedScore":null,"selectionMode":null,"experiment":null,"sources":[],"textHash":"ec814cb181419cd64326"}
{"at":"2026-11-15T00:47:21.613Z","account":"music-tools-x","platform":"x","status":"published","source":"manual","slotId":"music-tools-x:workflow:43659898871","text":"残響を「部屋」より「パッド」に使いたい人へ。無料のTin Roofは、リバーブの尾をHOLDで凍らせ、拍に合わせて刻めるプラグイン。きれいな部屋鳴りが欲しい人には別の選択肢がよさそう。","mediaUrl":"https://kikiwafford.com/tinroof/img/roof.png","mediaType":"image","mediaAltText":null,"mediaQa":null,"mediaResolution":null,"commercial":{"kind":"organic","paidPartnership":false},"providerPostId":"2121766972555948467","ai":null,"features":null,"rationale":null,"predictedScore":null,"selectionMode":null,"experiment":null,"sources":[],"textHash":"005c84dfe4b086e6e922"}
{"at":"2026-11-15T11:12:52.844Z","account":"music-tools-x","platform":"x","status":"published","source":"manual","slotId":"music-tools-x:workflow:43707814426","text":"今週の無料プラグインまとめ ・bubblegum（Your Smile is Art）— 音符単位で直せる無料ピッチエディタ ・Polarity-RES（Polarity）— 最大32点の共鳴エフェクト ・Tin Roof（Brownie Digital）— 残響を凍らせるリバーブ 定番で足りるなら追加は不要。","mediaUrl":"https://polarity.productions/polarity-res/assets/images/polarity-res-cover.jpg","mediaType":"image","mediaAltText":null,"mediaQa":null,"mediaResolution":null,"commercial":{"kind":"organic","paidPartnership":false},"providerPostId":"2121924389406904733","ai":null,"features":null,"rationale":null,"predictedScore":null,"selectionMode":null,"experiment":null,"sources":[],"textHash":"a9c1a3372be2f77bc582"}
{"at":"2026-11-16T00:34:35.754Z","account":"music-tools-x","platform":"x","status":"published","source":"manual","slotId":"music-tools-x:workflow:43781163571","text":"粒の一つひとつを空間に散らす、IEMのGranularEncoder。モノ／ステレオ音を細かな断片に分け、Ambisonics空間へ配置する発想が面白い。通常のステレオ制作向けというより、立体音響やサウンドデザインを試す人向けです。","mediaUrl":"https://plugins.iem.at/docs/granularencoder/granularEncoder_screenshot.png","mediaType":"image","mediaAltText":null,"mediaQa":null,"mediaResolution":null,"commercial":{"kind":"organic","paidPartnership":false},"providerPostId":"2122126148096143544","ai":null,"features":null,"rationale":null,"predictedScore":null,"selectionMode":null,"experiment":null,"sources":[],"textHash":"8a6cfc4bec258a35d1a9"}
{"at":"2026-11-16T11:18:37.518Z","account":"music-tools-x","platform":"x","status":"published","source":"manual","slotId":"music-tools-x:workflow:43856574140","text":"欲しいエフェクトを言葉で説明し、DAW内で形にする。Amorphは楽器・エフェクト・MIDIツールを作れる無料プラグインです。定番音源の置き換えというより、自分用の小さな道具を試作したい人向け。公開ベータなので、完成品を求める人は様子見でも。","mediaUrl":"https://artistsindsp.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/og-card.png","mediaType":"image","mediaAltText":null,"mediaQa":null,"mediaResolution":null,"commercial":{"kind":"organic","paidPartnership":false},"providerPostId":"2122288223300747504","ai":null,"features":null,"rationale":null,"predictedScore":null,"selectionMode":null,"experiment":null,"sources":[],"textHash":"8f1640aaca03d88a7edd"}
{"at":"2026-11-17T03:00:50.243Z","account":"music-tools-x","platform":"x","status":"published","source":"manual","slotId":"music-tools-x:workflow:44007073529","text":"ベースの歪みを「ファズ」か「ザラついたクランチ」かで選べる、GullDSPの無料プラグインPhathom。歪ませる前に低域・高域を調整できるのが特徴です。Windows専用なので、Macユーザーは対象外。定番のベース歪みで困っていなければ、無理に足す必要はありません。","mediaUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/S1kcLkOGD1U/maxresdefault.jpg","mediaType":"image","mediaAltText":null,"mediaQa":null,"mediaResolution":null,"commercial":{"kind":"organic","paidPartnership":false},"providerPostId":"2122525338345299969","ai":null,"features":null,"rationale":null,"predictedScore":null,"selectionMode":null,"experiment":null,"sources":[],"textHash":"a2209e4316aa857e07ce"}
{"at":"2026-11-17T12:15:27.412Z","account":"music-tools-x","platform":"x","status":"published","source":"manual","slotId":"music-tools-x:workflow:44081397054","text":"Soundtrapのデスクトップ版で、手持ちのVST3音源を読み込めるように。ブラウザ中心の共同制作は続けつつ、外部シンセも使いたい人には選択肢が広がります。対象プランとデスクトップアプリが必要なので、既存DAWで完結する人は急がなくてよさそう。","mediaUrl":"https://support.soundtrap.com/hc/article_attachments/40798474318482","mediaType":"image","mediaAltText":null,"mediaQa":null,"mediaResolution":null,"commercial":{"kind":"organic","paidPartnership":false},"providerPostId":"2122664912665108811","ai":null,"features":null,"rationale":null,"predictedScore":null,"selectionMode":null,"experiment":null,"sources":[],"textHash":"02d3e8f871f0537e556b"}
{"at":"2026-11-18T00:40:02.307Z","account":"music-tools-x","platform":"x","status":"published","source":"manual","slotId":"music-tools-x:workflow:44209652495","text":"鍵盤で打ち込む代わりに、歌った旋律をMIDIにする。Algoriffix Pitch Perfekt 2.0は、ボーカルからリアルタイムで音符を拾うツール。新バージョンでは歌声の変換や4声ハーモニーも追加。鼻歌を編曲の入口にしたい人向けで、鍵盤入力が速い人には急ぎの導入ではなさそう。","mediaUrl":"https://www.algoriffix.com/assets/pitch_perfekt-DEimQhGU.png","mediaType":"image","mediaAltText":null,"mediaQa":null,"mediaResolution":null,"commercial":{"kind":"organic","paidPartnership":false},"providerPostId":"2122852292437131359","ai":null,"features":null,"rationale":null,"predictedScore":null,"selectionMode":null,"experiment":null,"sources":[],"textHash":"105baa29e34fc50909cc"}
{"at":"2026-11-18T11:50:21.242Z","account":"music-tools-x","platform":"x","status":"published","source":"manual","slotId":"music-tools-x:workflow:44298261872","text":"バスコンプを探している人は、RiverFlux AudioのRF-BUSも候補に。無料のRelicコレクションに加わったステレオ・バスコンプレッサーです。すでに使い慣れたコンプで困っていないなら、コレクションを増やす目的だけで入れなくても。","mediaUrl":"https://riverfluxaudio.com/assets/studio/relic-rf-bus/angle.webp","mediaType":"image","mediaAltText":null,"mediaQa":null,"mediaResolution":null,"commercial":{"kind":"organic","paidPartnership":false},"providerPostId":"2123020983342624869","ai":null,"features":null,"rationale":null,"predictedScore":null,"selectionMode":null,"experiment":null,"sources":[],"textHash":"690090565ba24012e665"}
{"at":"2026-11-19T00:59:28.561Z","account":"music-tools-x","platform":"x","status":"published","source":"manual","slotId":"music-tools-x:workflow:44433371377","text":"キックが鳴るたび、ベースとの位相を調整するPhaseKicker。ベースに挿し、キックをサイドチェインへ送る設計です。低域の調整を自動化したい人向け。ただし処理遅延が大きく、録音やライブ用途には向きません。","mediaUrl":"https://cdn.rekkerd.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/StereoGhost-PhaseKicker.jpg","mediaType":"image","mediaAltText":null,"mediaQa":null,"mediaResolution":null,"commercial":{"kind":"organic","paidPartnership":false},"providerPostId":"2123219572534776316","ai":null,"features":null,"rationale":null,"predictedScore":null,"selectionMode":null,"experiment":null,"sources":[],"textHash":"44de9ca68bc7aacbcd86"}
